# Phishing Email Analysis Lab

## Overview

This project documents the analysis of simulated phishing emails to identify indicators of compromise and social engineering tactics.

The objective was to practice:
- Email threat analysis
- Header investigation
- URL inspection
- Phishing detection techniques

---

## Investigation Summary

A suspicious email claiming to be from a financial institution was analyzed for malicious indicators.

---

## Indicators Identified

- Suspicious sender domain
- Spoofed branding
- Misleading hyperlink destination
- Urgent social engineering language
- Suspicious attachment behavior

---

## Analysis Steps

### Header Review
Examined email headers for sender inconsistencies and relay information.

### URL Inspection
Reviewed embedded URLs and checked reputation using VirusTotal.

### Domain Investigation
Performed WHOIS lookups on sender domains.

